{
  "id": "poem-078",
  "body": "<div class=\"poem-text\"><p class=\"poem-stanza\" id=\"verse-1\"><span class=\"poem-line\">经历漆黑，我孤独前行，</span><span class=\"poem-line\">在绝望中，远方微弱的光芒闪烁。</span><span class=\"poem-line\">在夜的深渊，它静静燃烧，</span><span class=\"poem-line\">指引踉跄的步伐，走向未知的远方。</span></p><p class=\"poem-stanza\" id=\"verse-2\"><span class=\"poem-line\">在黑暗的尽头，那光透亮而温暖，</span><span class=\"poem-line\">我以慢步靠近，心中充满感慨。</span><span class=\"poem-line\">光影中，我见到了自己的模样，</span><span class=\"poem-line\">曾渺小、曾脆弱，却也永不退缩。</span></p><p class=\"poem-stanza\" id=\"verse-3\"><span class=\"poem-line\">现在，我站在光明之中，</span><span class=\"poem-line\">每一道光束都洒满希望与力量。</span><span class=\"poem-line\">我欣然前行，在未来的路上，</span><span class=\"poem-line\">黑暗已去，光明照在身旁。</span></p></div><figure class=\"poem-illustration\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"poem-art-open\" data-poem-art=\"/books/jing-mi-de-kuang-chao/art/078.webp\" data-caption=\"《大日如来》\" aria-label=\"放大欣赏插画《大日如来》\"><img src=\"/books/jing-mi-de-kuang-chao/art/078.webp\" width=\"885\" height=\"1050\" alt=\"亮子绘制的原书插画《大日如来》\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></button><figcaption>《大日如来》 · 亮子<span>轻触画面，放大欣赏</span></figcaption></figure><p class=\"poem-original-page\">原书第 79 页</p>"
}
